# Netlify SPA fallback.
#
# CheckWise routes on the client (/login, /dashboard, /exams/:id …), so a hard
# refresh on any of those asks Netlify for a file that does not exist. This
# hands every unmatched path to index.html and lets the router sort it out.
#
# Real files still win: /checkwise.apk is served as the APK, not rewritten.
/*  /index.html  200
